      <slug></slug>
      <title>Context Based Access Control gem for Rails</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Ruby + Rails</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The CBAC system contains the following features:&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Separate authorization logic from your code&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt; Supports Role Based Access Control. Authorization based on group membership.&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt; Supports Context Based Access Control. Group membership is determined on user and context of requested resource.&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt; Easy to use.&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt; Authorization on the level of controller methods. Specify authorization per controller method.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description></description>
